    "summary": "Customer Hana Sato (verified) says order Q-7501 from Big Slice Pizza never arrived; she checked her door at 7:10pm and found nothing. Delivery events show handoff at 19:02 left_at_door with photo proof PH-55120 (bag at door of apt 1204). No refund or credit issued. Customer wants the order refunded/resolved."
